seg-c128455c353c = Every run writes a versioned, self-describing JSON (JavaScript Object Notation) artifact next to the scenario. This page is the hand-written reader's guide to the interchange envelope and to the <b>clock and orbit</b> result shapes: each field's <b>unit</b>, where it is computed in the source, and how to read it. The canonical type is <c1/> in <a1><c2/></a1>; the figures of merit are <c3/> in <a2><c4/></a2>.

