# c2: engine_version
# c3: scenario_hash
seg-f7ae91002e56 = <b>Determinism.</b> The envelope carries <b>no timestamp</b> — Kshana's reproducibility promise (<c1/> reproduces a run) requires it. Provenance lives in <c2/> and the payload's own <c3/>.

